!docs/SPECTRE_Operator_Guide.docx
# docs/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Five "!docs/*.ext" negations used to sit
# here trying to carve it back out from a "docs/*" rule further down, and they
# never worked: gitignore applies the LAST matching rule, so the broad rule
# always won. Both the rule and the negations are gone. Nothing here excludes
# docs/ now, and nothing should: .dockerignore keeps it out of the image, the
# packager deletes it from the staging tree, sonar.sources names only spectre
# and tle_clustering, and package-appstore.sh REQUIRES docs/CHANGE-LEDGER.md to
# exist. tests/unit/test_docs_are_committable.py probes a new file and fails if
# this comes back.

# Additional .env spellings the base pattern misses
# Claude Code
# Claude Code memory
# Claude persona / prompt scratch files
# Coverage output directory
# Distribution / packaging
# IDE / editors
# Jupyter
# Local container verification scratch
# Local runtime data directory (the container uses the FILE_STORAGE mount)
# Mypy
# Packaged upload artefacts
# PyInstaller
# PySide6 / Qt
# Pytest / coverage
# Python
# Reference documents (PDFs, Word docs) — exclude binaries but track Markdown/text docs
# Ruff
# SQLite / local databases
# STK scenario outputs and scratch files
# Sample / reference data files
# Virtual environments
# Windows
